on":"IGF::OT::IGF 1. THE DEPARTMENT OF VETERANS AFFAIRS (VA), OFFICE OF INFORMATION AND TECHNOLOGY (OI&T), INFORMATION TECHNOLOGY RESOURCE MANAGEMENT (ITRM), REGION 1 HAS A REQUIREMENT FOR CONTINUED CONNECTIVITY TO THE CIRCUIT EXTENSIONS/CROSS CONNECTS AT A LEASED DATA CENTER IN SACRAMENTO, CALIFORNIA.  UNDER A SEPARATE LEASE CONTRACT, VA, OI&T, ITRM, REGION 1 HOUSES VA-OWNED INFORMATION TECHNOLOGY (IT) EQUIPMENT IN A LEASED CAGED AREA WITHIN A DATA CENTER FACILITY OWNED BY QUALITY INVESTMENT PROPERTIES (QIP).  THE DATA CENTER IS DESIGNED FOR COLLOCATED AND MANAGED IT SERVICES.  UNDER THE LEASE CONTRACT, THE LESSOR PROVIDES THE CAGED DATA CENTER FLOOR SPACE, TELECOM/NETWORK CONNECTIVITY, FACILITY SECURITY, AND OPERATIONS SUPPORT.  THE PROPOSED ACTION IS TO PROVIDE FOR CONTINUED CONNECTIVITY TO THE CIRCUIT EXTENSIONS/CROSS CONNECTS FROM THE BUILDING DEMARCATION POINT TO VA DATA CENTER EQUIPMENT FOR VA, OI&T, ITRM REGION 1 AT THE QIP CAGED DATA CENTER FACILITY LOCATED AT 1100 NORTH MARKET BOULEVARD, SACRAMENTO, CALIFORNIA.","generated_unique_award_id":null,"Awarding Agency":"Department of Veterans Affairs","awarding_agency_id":561,"agency_slug":"department-of-veterans-affairs","generated_internal_id":"CONT_AWD_VA11817C2111_3600_-NONE-_-NONE-"},{"internal_id":348238056,"Award ID":"VA25917J5750","Award Amount":109552.87,"Description":"426-4Q NETWORKFLEET 3500SM12S WIRELESS SERVICE IGF::OT::IGF","generated_unique_award_id":null,"Awarding Agency":"Department of Veterans Affairs","awarding_agency_id":561,"agency_slug":"department-of-veterans-affairs","generated_internal_id":"CONT_AWD_VA25917J5750_3600_VA25915A0089_3600"},{"internal_id":279966288,"Award ID":"36C10A21F0010","Award Amount":112486.72,"Description":"FRESNO GUEST WI-FI","generated_unique_award_id":null,"Awarding Agency":"Department of Veterans Affairs","awarding_agency_id":561,"agency_slug":"department-of-veterans-affairs","generated_internal_id":"CONT_AWD_36C10A21F0010_3600_GS00T07NSD0007_4735"},{"internal_id":